Package: capnet
Type: Package
Title: Contribution-Capped Elastic Net Regularization
Version: 0.3.3
Date: 2026-09-21
Authors@R: person("Harry", "He", email = "zih028@ucsd.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements contribution-capped regularization to directly bound
    per-feature contributions in predictive models. Includes Orthant-Wise Limited-memory 
    Quasi Newton (OWL-QN) optimization, cross-validation, walk-forward fitting and 
    prediction, and plotting utilities.
URL: https://github.com/harryziyuhe/capnet
